 "description": "Use this when the user wants full details for one free Smart Link, including release, Spotify URL, public play.dynamoi.com URL, current status, theme source, and next actions. Set includeAnalytics=true for visit/click analytics and includeArtistSettings=true for artist-level theme/pixel settings. In the final answer, lead with the public URL and do not expose internal IDs unless asked.",
